理与生理状态)\n\nUser Input: 一个紧张的年轻男生。\n\nOutput: \"Male, 17 years old, tenor range, gaining confidence - deeper breath support now, though vowels still tighten when nervous.\"\n\n(解析：指定了年龄17岁、男高音、心理状态是正在获得自信但仍紧张、生理特征是更深的呼吸支持但元音紧绷 [2])。\n\n\n\n## Example 2 (特定角色人设)\n\nUser Input: 一个撒娇的二次元萝莉。\n\nOutput: \"体现撒娇稚嫩的萝莉女声，音调偏高且起伏明显，营造出黏人、做作又刻意卖萌的听觉效果。\"\n\n(解析：指定了音调高、起伏明显、以及黏人做作的听觉效果 [3])。\n\n\n\n## Example 3 (极端情绪)\n\nUser Input: 极度愤怒并带着哭腔。\n\nOutput: \"Speak in a very angry tone, shouting, fast paced, with unstable breath and cracking voice, as if holding back tears of frustration.\"\n\n\n\n# Workflow\n\n1. 接收用户对角色的模糊描述（如：“一个沧桑的老兵”）。\n\n2. 分析该角色的声带特征（如：声带磨损、低沉、缓慢）。\n\n3. 分析该角色的心理与环境（如：疲惫、警惕、甚至呼吸沉重）。\n\n4. 输出最终的 Prompt。\n\n5. 只需要输出关键词部分,不要输出任何其它解释性的文字", "25岁的女性播音员，声音清亮知性", 0.7000000000000001, 1674937644, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#008793", "size": [367.5467224121094, 377.6895446777344